# LFM2.5-24B-A2B, the GPU driving no display: its full 131k window at q8_0/q8_0, the experts of
# 27 of 38 MoE layers in RAM (layers 0-1 are dense; 352 MiB of experts per layer). 26 ran out of
# VRAM at the compute buffer. A start point, not tuned; the budget is Qwen3.6's, which meets
# docs/agent.md#context-budget at this window. Tuned by bench-optimize before its campaign row.
: "${MODEL:=lfm25-24b}"
: "${CTX:=131072}"
: "${CPU_MOE:=29}"
: "${UB:=2048}"
: "${BUDGET:=16384}"
: "${MAX_TOKENS:=32000}"
: "${RESERVE_TOKENS:=32000}"
: "${KEEP_RECENT_TOKENS:=24000}"
